戶的合作，提升產品附加價值與客戶黏著度。","summary":"南亞科2026年第二季的營收結構主要以DDR4與LPDDR4合計佔總營收超過70%，DDR5與DDR3則各佔約10%。在2026年上半年，AI基礎設施與伺服器應用佔南亞科營收的比例已超過20%。公司主要客戶涵蓋NVIDIA、Google、Microsoft、Intel、AMD、Qualcomm等全球主要晶片與雲端業者，以及SanDisk、Kioxia、Solidigm和Cisco等策略投資人兼客戶。","source_type":"news","source":"南亞科做什麼的？解析台灣DRAM 記憶體大廠4 大業務、2026 最新財報與未來展望 (2026/09/30)","data_period":"2026 Q2","updated_at":"2026-10-06"}}],"dualFilterExcluded":[],"sectors":[{"sector":"光通訊","ret20":15.72,"rsi":58.8,"buy":3,"hot":2},{"sector":"記憶體","ret20":20.07,"rsi":55.7,"buy":2,"hot":1},{"sector":"AI伺服器","ret20":-3.05,"rsi":47.8,"buy":4,"hot":0},{"sector":"封測","ret20":14.32,"rsi":54.1,"buy":1,"hot":1},{"sector":"光學","ret20":-1.39,"rsi":41.2,"buy":0,"hot":0},{"sector":"IC設計","ret20":7.93,"rsi":45.1,"buy":1,"hot":0},{"sector":"車用電子","ret20":-9.85,"rsi":27.1,"buy":0,"hot":0},{"sector":"綠能環保","ret20":-8.14,"rsi":30.8,"buy":0,"hot":0}],"chips":[],"stocks":[{"date":"20260224","sector":"光通訊","id":"4979","name":"華星光","price":393.0,"rsi":76.6,"rsi10":"","ret20":43.7,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":0.87,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20260224","sector":"光通訊","id":"3450","name":"聯鈞","price":280.0,"rsi":62.8,"rsi10":"","ret20":11.8,"signal":"BUY","sharpe":2.72,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20260224","sector":"光通訊","id":"3665","name":"貿聯-KY","price":1295.0,"rsi":40.4,"rsi10":"","ret20":-7.5,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":6.27,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipDays":null,"chipConc":null,"chipDualBuy":null,"trustDays":null,"chipTier":null,"news":""},{"date":"20260224","sector":"光通訊","id":"3105","name":"穩懋","price":297.5,"rsi":64.5,"rsi10":"","ret20":36.2,"signal":"HOLD","sharpe":-0.75,"foreign":"","trust":"","dealer":"","chipTotal":0,"chip5d":null,"chipD